wip/py-lib3mf: Import py-lib3mf-2.5.0

The Python (ctypes) binding of lib3mf (wip/lib3mf), installed as the
"lib3mf" package with the same layout as the PyPI wheel: Lib3MF.py, an
__init__.py written for pkgsrc (the wheel's is not in the source
tree) and a lib3mf.dylib symlink to the pkgsrc library.  Needed by
build123d (wip/py-build123d) for 3MF import and export.
